      "rationale": "DSA remains gold standard for aneurysm characterization and treatment planning. Labs identify coagulopathy, hyponatremia, or myocardial injury. ECG and CXR screen for neurogenic stunned myocardium and pulmonary complications. Repeat CT detects complications like hydrocephalus. TCD monitors for vasospasm progression.",
